{"id":"n55874-1-7","stage":0,"title":"목요일 · 星期四","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55874-1-7-1","ko":"그럼 약속 날짜는 언제로 정할까?","zh":"那我们把约定的日期定在什么时候呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"약속","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}},{"text":"날짜는","meaning":"日子，日期","explanation":"날짜：日子，日期；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"날짜","audio":"/audio/09f76a1b7a6712eeafef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58157","senseId":"2","lemma":"날짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날짜는","audio":"/audio/d200c3779ee21ef99f2b.mp3"}},{"text":"언제로","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제로","audio":"/audio/98848aa0884462d0956f.mp3"}},{"text":"정할까?","meaning":"定，选定","explanation":"정하다：定，选定；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29767","senseId":"1","lemma":"정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정할까","audio":"/audio/f246ab233dd0e19713ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"